# The cases of faults_trace.anti: a name and the value of ANTI_FAULT, see
# tests/CMakeLists.txt. alloc counts the memory of the runtime after the
# start: capture takes the fifth for its frames and the sixth on for the
# modules of each, symbolize the twelfth for its list and the thirteenth
# for a name, and the text of the trace the sixteenth and the
# seventeenth.
frames_memory alloc:5:ENOMEM
module_memory alloc:6:ENOMEM
names_memory alloc:12:ENOMEM
name_memory alloc:13:ENOMEM
text_memory alloc:16:ENOMEM
text_room_memory alloc:17:ENOMEM
